\subsubsection{Period $N = 12$}
The period $N=12$ is realised by $93$ parameter sets across $2\\times2$, $2\\times3$, $2\\times4$, $2\\times6$, $3\\times3$, $3\\times4$, $3\\times6$, $4\\times4$, $4\\times6$, $6\\times6$. The reflection parameters take values in $\{$0.0893$, $0.1340$, $0.2500$, $0.2679$, $0.3333$, $0.4574$, $0.9330$\}$, and the phase parameters in $\{$0.3333\pi$, $0.5000\pi$, $0.6667\pi$, $1.0000\pi$, $1.7500\pi$, $2.0000\pi$\}$. This highly composite period is one of the most populated
in the classification.
